    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000sams](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000sams) Magnitude 6.0 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Feb 21 2026 55km S of Santa Ana Island. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -11.3339 longitude 162.3952. It impacted 808 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
